1
00:03:33,333 --> 00:03:39,333
A merciless crime turns a man into an outlaw.

2
00:07:06,666 --> 00:07:12,666
Batman: Year One is a action, animation, crime film directed by Sam Liu.

3
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:46,000
A wealthy playboy named Bruce Wayne and a Chicago cop named Jim Gordon both
return to Gotham City where their lives unexpectedly intersect.

4
00:14:13,333 --> 00:14:19,333
Batman / Bruce Wayne (voice), played by Ben McKenzie.

5
00:17:46,666 --> 00:17:52,666
Jim Gordon (voice), played by Bryan Cranston.

6
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:26,000
Selina (voice), played by Eliza Dushku.

7
00:24:53,333 --> 00:24:59,333
Commissioner Loeb (voice), played by Jon Polito.

8
00:28:26,666 --> 00:28:32,666
Falcone (voice), played by Alex Rocco.

9
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Detective Essen (voice), played by Katee Sackhoff.

10
00:35:33,333 --> 00:35:39,333
Batman: Year One is a 2011 American adult animated superhero film based on
the four-issue story arc of the same name printed in 1987.

11
00:39:06,666 --> 00:39:12,666
It was directed by Lauren Montgomery and Sam Liu.

12
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:46,000
The film premiered at Comic-Con on July 22 and was
officially released on October 18, 2011.

13
00:46:13,333 --> 00:46:19,333
It is the 12th film released under the DC Universe Animated Original Movies
banner and was released on DVD, Blu-ray and digital copy.

14
00:49:46,666 --> 00:49:52,666
The film received positive reviews upon release for its
animation and faithfulness to the source material.

15
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:26,000
It was also a commercial success, bringing in $6.1
million on a budget of $3.5 million.

16
00:56:53,333 --> 00:56:59,333
The film explores themes of superhero, based on comic,
vigilante, police corruption, based on graphic novel.

17
01:00:26,666 --> 01:00:32,666
The tone is emotional and intense.
